The objective was to create a small enterprise-style identity environment for a fictional organization named Adithya Tech Demo and 
establish the foundation for future IAM activities such as user lifecycle management, RBAC, access reviews, and privileged access management.

## 🏢 Organization

Organization: Adithya Tech Demo  
Identity Platform: Microsoft Entra ID  
Cloud Platform: Microsoft Azure

The lab environment was designed to represent a simplified enterprise organization with separate departments and delegated administrative scope.


## 🎯 Objectives

The main objectives of this project were:

- Set up an IAM workspace using Microsoft Entra ID.
- Configure the organization's tenant.
- Create department-based security groups.
- Create test user accounts.
- Assign users to appropriate groups.
- Create an Administrative Unit for the IT HelpDesk.
- Explore custom domain configuration.
- Document the IAM environment for future projects.
